      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Give your opinion on a topic in your town, such as traffic, prices or noise. Use creo que, me parece que, para mí and en mi opinión.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Give your opinion aloud on three recent news stories and say whether you agree with what others think."
